sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as model-extractor CLI
    participant HFC as HuggingFace Collections<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HFM as HuggingFace Model API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HFR as HuggingFace README<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reg as registry.redhat.io<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GHR as raw.githubusercontent.com<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over CLI,FS: Flow 1: Model Metadata Extraction Pipeline
        CLI->>HFC: GET /api/collections/RedHatAI<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
        HFC-->>CLI: Model collection list
        CLI->>FS: Write data/models-index.yaml

        loop For each model (5 concurrent goroutines)
            CLI->>Reg: GET /v2/{image}/manifests/{tag}<br/>Auth: Docker credentials
            Reg-->>CLI: OCI manifest + config blob
            CLI->>Reg: GET /v2/{image}/blobs/{layer}<br/>Auth: Docker credentials
            Note right of Reg: Layer with annotation<br/>io.opendatahub.modelcar.layer.type: modelcard
            Reg-->>CLI: Model card layer (tar.gz)
            CLI->>FS: Write output/{model}/models/metadata.yaml

            CLI->>HFM: GET /api/models/{model-id}<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
            HFM-->>CLI: Model details (tags, pipeline, license)
            CLI->>HFR: GET /{org}/{model}/raw/main/README.md<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN (optional)
            HFR-->>CLI: README with YAML frontmatter

            Note over CLI: Enrichment priority:<br/>1. HF YAML frontmatter<br/>2. Container modelcard<br/>3. HF API data<br/>4. Repo tags<br/>5. Generated fallbacks

            CLI->>FS: Write output/{model}/models/enrichment.yaml
        end

        CLI->>FS: Write data/models-catalog.yaml<br/>Write data/validated-models-catalog.yaml
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over CLI,FS: Flow 2: MCP Servers Catalog Pipeline
        CLI->>FS: Read input/mcp_servers/{tier}/*.yaml<br/>(redhat, partner, community)

        loop For each MCP server with OCI image
            CLI->>Reg: GET /v2/{image}/manifests/{tag}<br/>Auth: Docker credentials
            Reg-->>CLI: Architecture + timestamp metadata
        end

        CLI->>FS: Write data/{tier}-mcp-servers-catalog.yaml
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over CLI,FS: Flow 3: Agents Catalog Pipeline
        loop For each agent starter kit
            CLI->>GH: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/branches/{branch}<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
            GH-->>CLI: Branch validation + commit SHA
            CLI->>GHR: GET /{owner}/{repo}/{branch}/agent.yaml<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
            GHR-->>CLI: Agent configuration YAML
            CLI->>GHR: GET /{owner}/{repo}/{branch}/README.md<br/>Auth: Bearer GITHUB_TOKEN (optional)
            GHR-->>CLI: Agent README content
        end

        CLI->>FS: Write data/redhat-agents-catalog.yaml
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over CLI,FS: Packaging: Data Container Build
        Note over FS: Dockerfile.konflux:<br/>COPY data/ catalogs/<br/>COPY sample-data/ benchmarks/<br/>CMD sleep infinity
        Note over FS: → ubi9-minimal data container<br/>consumed by Dashboard & Model Registry
    end
